  R1*22 | \tag #'score { R1*2 } \tag #'part { \cueDuring #"vcQ" #UP { <>^\markup \tiny "Vc." R1*2 } } |  % c135: cue in the part before the entry after a long rest (MOLA PDF 5: logical, audible cues during long rests)
 
